message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Exsecutor"
abstract: "A systems language in which locale and target are capabilities, never ambient state, with a checked Latin morphological lexicon for public names; and its compiler, exsc, written in freestanding x86-64 assembly with a closed syscall allowlist so the compiler's purity contract is a property of the artifact."
version: "0.4"
authors:
